              "topic": "Foramina of Middle Cranial Fossa",
              "question": "During base of skull surgery, a surgeon identifies the foramen through which the middle meningeal artery ascends into the cranial vault. If this vessel is lacerated following a blow to the pterion, an extradural hematoma develops. Through which skull foramen does this artery enter?",
