              "topic": "Tongue Innervation & Development",
              "question": "A patient experiences loss of taste sensation from the anterior two-thirds of the tongue following a complicated dental extraction of a lower mandibular molar, while general somatic touch and temperature sensation remain preserved. Which nerve carries the special sensory (taste) fibers from the anterior two-thirds of the tongue?",
