              "question": "A 26-year-old female with generalized tonic-clonic epilepsy plans to conceive. When counselling her regarding antiepileptic drug selection, which AED carries the HIGHEST risk of major congenital malformations, specifically neural tube defects (spina bifida) and impaired cognitive neurodevelopment?",
