                "rationale": "Carbamazepine is the first-line drug of choice for classic Trigeminal Neuralgia (tic douloureux). It works by blocking voltage-gated sodium channels in hyperexcitable trigeminal nociceptive afferents, dampening high-frequency repetitive action potential firing.",
