              "topic": "Toxicology - Tricyclic Antidepressant Overdose",
              "question": "A 24-year-old female presents obtunded after an overdose of Amitriptyline. ECG reveals sinus tachycardia with a widened QRS complex of 144 ms and a dominant R wave in lead aVR. Which of the following is the specific life-saving medical intervention?",
