                "high_yield_pearl": "MRSA resistance = mecA gene encoding PBP-2a (altered penicillin-binding protein). Drug of choice = Vancomycin, Linezolid, or Daptomycin. Ceftaroline is the only beta-lactam active against MRSA!"
