              "topic": "Staphylococcus aureus vs S. epidermidis vs S. saprophyticus",
              "question": "A 22-year-old sexually active female presents with acute dysuria and frequency. Urine culture yields Gram-positive, catalase-positive, coagulase-negative cocci that are NOVOBIOCIN RESISTANT. What is the organism?",
