                  "B": "INCORRECT: Against-the-rule astigmatism; corrected with minus cylinder at 90 degrees is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Irregular astigmatism; corrected with spherical lenses is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
