                  "B": "INCORRECT: Nerve to Stapedius is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Chorda Tympani nerve inside middle ear is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Stylomastoid foramen is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
