                  "B": "INCORRECT: Forehead muscles are innervated by the trigeminal nerve is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Forehead muscles do not have motor units is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: The lower face receives bilateral innervation is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
