                "rationale": "Genetic counseling is a service for individuals and families who have, or are at risk for, a genetic condition. A\ncouple who has already had an affected child would need counseling to understand the diagnosis, prognosis, and recurrence\nrisk for future pregnancies. The other options are not genetic conditions.",
