              "topic": "Acromegaly Diagnostics & Complications",
              "question": "A 42-year-old male presents with widening shoe size, ring tightness, coarse facial features with prominent supraorbital ridges, prognathism (jaw protrusion), macroglossia, and excessive sweating. Serum IGF-1 is elevated at 640 ng/mL. What is the gold-standard biochemical confirmatory test, and what is the first-line surgical treatment?",
