                "high_yield_pearl": "Hypokalemic Metabolic Alkalosis Differential by Blood Pressure & Renin/Aldo:\n• HYPERTENSION + High Aldosterone / Low Renin -> Primary Hyperaldosteronism (Conn's).\n• HYPERTENSION + Low Aldosterone / Low Renin -> Liddle Syndrome (ENaC mutation, treat with Amiloride) OR Syndrome of Apparent Mineralocorticoid Excess (SAME / 11-beta-HSD2 deficiency) OR Cushing's.\n• NORMAL / LOW BP + High Renin / High Aldosterone -> Bartter syndrome (thick ascending limb defect) or Gitelman syndrome (distal tubule NCCT defect)."
