                  "B": "INCORRECT: Concomitant Respiratory Acidosis is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "C": "INCORRECT: Concomitant Respiratory Alkalosis is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario.",
                  "D": "INCORRECT: Mixed metabolic alkalosis is not the primary mechanism, culprit, or first-line choice in this clinical scenario."
