              "question": "A 68-year-old diabetic male with baseline serum creatinine of 1.8 mg/dL (eGFR 38 mL/min) is scheduled for elective contrast-enhanced CT angiography. What is the only proven, guideline-recommended preventive measure to reduce the risk of Contrast-Induced Acute Kidney Injury (CI-AKI)?",
